e developing the data and action layer for AI agents.`,headingHighlight:`data and action layer`,description:`Come build the future of context infrastructure with us.`,primaryCta:{label:`View open roles`,href:`#${k}`},secondaryCta:{label:`Life at Airbyte`,href:`#${A}`}},M={tagline:`Why Airbyte, why now`,heading:`What's it actually like to work here?`,headingHighlight:`work here?`,teamPhoto:{src:`/images/careers/team-photo.webp`,alt:`Airbyte team collaborating in the San Francisco office`},cards:[{title:`Everyone owns the outcome`,body:`We are a small team in San Francisco, working in person, because the hardest problems get solved faster when we are in the same room. Everyone here takes real ownership, moves with urgency, and holds a high bar for the work and for each other, with our users at the center of every decision. It is a lean team where your work matters and the pace is real.`},{title:`The work is ambitious and meaningful`,body:`AI agents are rapidly becoming the primary consumers of enterprise data. We started in 2020 by bringing data to humans through open source, and grew to 700+ connectors trusted by thousands of companies. Now we are building the context layer that lets agents access that data at production scale. What we build shapes how the next generation of software gets made.`}]},N={tagline:`Our values`,heading:`How we work`,items:[{icon:`play`,title:`Own the outcome`,body:`We take ownership from end to end, prioritizing outcomes over activity. We act with urgency. We ship, learn, and adjust rather than waiting for perfect answers.`},{icon:`intersect-circle`,title:`All in together`,body:`We work with trust, respect, and shared context. We debate openly, decide quickly at the right level, and execute as one. We commit and support one another.`},{icon:`magic-wand-02`,title:`Execution excellence`,body:`We build scalable systems and continuously improve our work. We optimize for efficiency and stay accountable. Everyone uses AI as a core tool.`},{icon:`face-content`,title:`Users first`,body:`We obsess over our users' success and look for every opportunity to delight them. We prioritize simple, usable solutions rather than over-engineering.`}],handbookCta:{label:`Read Our Company Handbook`,href:`https://app.notion.com/p/Company-Handbook-External-b69807c0d72646a3b3f58983cc9e522b`}},P={tagline:`Life at Airbyte`,heading:`We build together, in person`,description:`Our team works onsite four days a week in San Francisco. We believe great products are built through close collaboration, rapid iteration, and shared ownership. That's why we spend most of the week together in person, while keeping Friday an optional work-from-home day to support the balance and autonomy that help exceptional people do their best work.`,photos:[{src:`/images/careers/life-01.webp`,alt:`Team members at an office event`},{src:`/images/careers/life-02.webp`,alt:`Airbyte team social gathering`},{src:`/images/careers/life-03.webp`,alt:`Collaborative workspace moment`},{src:`/images/careers/life-09.webp`,alt:`Team members with a dog in the San Francisco office lounge`},{src:`/images/careers/life-04.webp`,alt:`Team lunch outdoors`},{src:`/images/careers/life-05.webp`,alt:`Office celebration`},{src:`/images/careers/life-06.webp`,alt:`Team photo at an event`},{src:`/images/careers/life-07.webp`,alt:`Group conversation in the office`},{src:`/images/careers/life-08.webp`,alt:`Team members working together`},{src:`/images/careers/life-10.webp`,alt:`Team gathered on a waterfront patio at sunset`},{src:`/images/careers/life-11.webp`,alt:`Team lunch at a restaurant overlooking the bay`}]},F={heading:`Trusted by 20% of the Fortune 500`,headingHighlight:`20% of the Fortune 500`,subheading:`Funded by leading investors`,stats:[{value:`30K`,label:`users`},{value:`20K`,label:`GitHub stars`},{value:`$181M`,label:`raised`},{value:`25K`,label:`companies`}]},I={tagline:`Take care of yourself`,heading:`Benefits and perks`,items:[{icon:`umbrella-01`,title:`Time off that's actually time off`,body:`Unlimited PTO with a real floor: we encourage at least 25 days off a year.`},{icon:`activity-heart`,title:`Comprehensive health coverage`,body:`Employer-sponsored medical, dental, and vision.`},{icon:`shield-tick`,title:`401(k)`,body:`A retirement plan for our U.S.-based team.`},{icon:`home-smile`,title:`Inclusive parental leave`,body:`16 weeks fully paid, no matter your gender or path to parenthood.`},{icon:`graduation-hat-01`,title:`Professional development`,body:`Reimbursed books, sponsored conferences and training, and growth from within.`},{icon:`bus`,title:`Commuter benefits`,body:`A pre-tax commuter FSA with an Airbyte contribution for our FiDi HQ.`}]},L={tagline:`Open roles`,heading:`Find your role`,award:{src:`/images/careers/built-in-award-source.png`,eyebrow:`Built In Award`,title:`50 Best Startups to Work 2025`}},R={title:`Build the future of context infrastructure with us`,description:`We're growing fast and always looking for exceptional builders.`,primaryCta:{label:`View open roles`,href:`#${k}`},secondaryCta:{label:`Join the community`,href:`https://airbyte.com/community`}},z=i();function B(){return(0,z.jsx)(x,{theme:`dark`,tagline:I.tagline,heading:I.heading,description:``,className:`ab-careers-benefits`,headingId:`careers-benefits-heading`,children:(0,z.jsx)(`ul`,{className:`ab-careers-benefits__grid`,children:I.items.map(e=>(0,z.jsx)(`li`,{className:`ab-careers-benefits__grid-item`,children:(0,z.jsx)(y,{variant:`copy-icon`,icon:e.icon,title:e.title,titleLevel:5,description:e.body,logos:[]})},e.title))})})}function V(){return(0,z.jsx)(b,{title:R.title,description:R.description,primaryCta:R.primaryCta,secondaryCta:{...R.secondaryCta,target:`_blank`,rel:`noopener noreferrer`,withIcon:!0}})}function H(e,t){let n=2*e-1;return 1-t*(1-n*n)}function U(e,t){return t<=1?0:e/(t-1)*2-1}function W(e,t,n,r){let i=n.angle*Math.PI/180,a=Math.cos(i),o=Math.sin(i),s=Math.sqrt(r.width*r.width+r.height*r.height)*1.75,c=(t-.5)*s,l=e*(Math.